"""BTIC + IMBAL prod script.

Architecture (mirrors 355pm_script with BTIC-specific state tracker):
  1. Startup
     - Load configs from configs_btic_options/ (time keyword "BTIC")
     - Install BTIC edge constants into helpers.* (scale by VIX)
     - Resolve BTIC ticker (STE{H/M/U/Z}{Y} Index) and verify NAME contains "BTIC"
     - Fetch pre-3:45 PM HIGH/LOW from blp.bdib
     - Build krishna sell/buy level ladders; init BTICStateTracker
  2. Pre-loop wait
     - Wait until MAIN_LOOP_START_TIME (15:50:07 ET)
  3. Tick loop (drift-free, wait_until each absolute schedule slot)
     - Skip the TIME_BLOCK window (15:55:00 to 15:55:30) and stop at MAIN_LOOP_END_TIME (15:59:00)
     - poll_btic_price + poll_latest_imbal
     - Update tracker (latches breaches; updates running min/max)
     - Build merged factor_dict (tracker factors + live_imbal factors)
     - Refresh SPXW chain, call prep_trades, filter already-fired (name,side) pairs
     - send_complex_two_waves for any remaining positive-size trades

No apply_size_limits, no manual sizing -- prep_trades handles dollar_target/max_size from the config.
"""
